    "Identify the exact product specifications and pricing for the Trail Shell Jacket.",
    "Quantify customer sentiment, average rating, positive themes, and negative feedback/objections from deduplicated customer reviews.",
    "Formulate a structured messaging recommendation (headline, primary benefit, objection handling, and proof points) grounded in customer voice and brand guidelines."
